186
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,920
[SPEAKER_01] Nisam imala poteškoća?

187
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:20,880
[SPEAKER_00] Ne, ne.

188
00:21:21,119 --> 00:21:21,200
